    <p class="note"><b>${esc(pr.coach)}</b> wants to move from <b>${esc(pr.from)}</b> to <b>${esc(pr.style)}</b>${pr.focus ? ` and shift to ${/^[aeiou]/i.test(pr.focus) ? 'an' : 'a'} ${esc(pr.focus.toLowerCase())}-focused offense` : ''}.</p>
